   - ``periodic_kinematics`` and ``periodic_preconditioner`` are used only with ``boundary_conditions periodic``.
   - The shear components (``23``, ``13``, ``12``, ``32``, ``31``, ``21``) of ``strain_rate``, ``target_strain``, ``target_load``, ``target_stress``, ``load_rate``, ``stress_rate`` and ``control_component`` are used only with ``boundary_conditions periodic``.
